Link: https://lore.kernel.org/c9b426a4e163aa3c4fe8b80c79f1a610f47ae7d8.1763075056.git.pabeni@redhat.com [1]
Closes: https://github.com/multipath-tcp/mptcp_net-next/issues/600 [2]
